    "text": "Given<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.36</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Cr</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.74</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.33</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.51</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />Among the following, the strongest reducing agent is:"
